  "details": "Hello, i am heavy into world/avatar optimizations(over 9 years experience).\n\ni was originally at 722-754 FPS, and decided to do a lot of hidden world optimizations,\n\nthat lead to me being up to an avg 884(high 905)\n\nThen, i decided to code my own shader.\n\nAfter doing a lot of optimizations and such last night i was up to 940-971 fps.\n\ndecided to work on my shader again, and logged into my map \"kami's lookout\" after today's update.\n\nAnd bam, i am back to 676-755(avg 722)\n\nand i didnt even do anything different.\n\nIt was right after today's update 11.24.2026(my birthday by the way)\n\ni will show screenshots from lastnight and the other days i was testing my map.\n\nVs today.\n\ni tried deleting the cache and everything ingame.\n\nusing pcmanager on my pc to clear its cache.... nope...still stuck, the only thing i seen the highest FPS for a moment was 791.\n\nmy pc specs:\n\nMotherBoard: Asrock X870E Nova\n\nRam: G.SKILL Trident Z5 Royal Neo Series DDR5 RAM 32GB 8000hz CL36-48-48-128 1.45V\n\nOS: Windows 11 Pro 25H2 - FSOS V11\n\nGPU: NVidia ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 4090 OC Edition 24GB GDDR6X\n\nCPU: AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D\n\nLiquid cooler: ARCTIC Liquid Freezer III 420\n\nmonitor: MPG \"321URX QD-OLED\" and \"LG 27GN950-B\"\n\nVR headset: Pimax 5K super.",
